// purpose: Discord Invite Hijacking Detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Discord%20Invite%20Hijacking%20Detection.kql
